#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.kmymoney.appdata.xml:9
msgid "KMyMoney"
msgstr "KMyMoney"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.kmymoney.appdata.xml:10
msgid "Personal finance manager based on double-entry bookkeeping"
msgstr "Upravitelj osobnim financijama temeljen na dvojnom knjigovodstvu"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.kmymoney.appdata.xml:12
msgid "KMyMoney is a personal finance manager by KDE. It comes with a large set of features while being easy to use for the non-technical user."
msgstr "KMyMoney je KDE-ov upravitelj osobnim financijama. Nudi velik broj mogućnosti, a jednostavan je za korištenje i korisnicima bez tehničkog predznanja."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.kmymoney.appdata.xml:13
msgid "It supports different account types, categorisation of expenses and incomes, reconciliation of bank accounts and import/export to the “QIF” file format. Direct download using the OFX and HBCI formats is also possible via plugins. Online banking support (statement download) is also provided for the OFX and HBCI protocols."
msgstr "Podržava različite vrste računa, kategorizaciju rashoda i prihoda, usklađivanje bankovnih računa te uvoz i izvoz datoteka formata „QIF”. Izravno preuzimanje podataka u formatima OFX i HBCI moguće je i putem dodataka. Podržano je i internetsko bankarstvo (preuzimanje izvoda) putem protokola OFX i HBCI."

#. (itstool) path: screenshot/caption
#: org.kde.kmymoney.appdata.xml:21
msgid "KMyMoney has a welcome page to help new users get off to a good start"
msgstr "KMyMoney ima početnu stranicu koja novim korisnicima pomaže u početku rada"

#. (itstool) path: screenshot/caption
#: org.kde.kmymoney.appdata.xml:25
msgid "The financial summary gives you an overview of your finances"
msgstr "Financijski sažetak pruža pregled vaših financija"

#. (itstool) path: screenshot/caption
#: org.kde.kmymoney.appdata.xml:29
msgid "Manage accounts e.g. by institutions they are held at"
msgstr "Upravljajte računima, primjerice prema financijskim institucijama u kojima se vode"
